;; Upstream provenance catalog — which external source each part of this
;; repo mirrors, with the URL that was actually fetched.
;;
;; The README says "the same layering as upstream langchain-core /
;; langgraph" but until this file nothing in the repo pinned WHICH
;; upstream documents the namespaces are ports of. Each entry names the
;; concept, the file(s) here that mirror it, and one URL.
;;
;; Discipline (enforced by test/langgraph/catalog_test.cljk):
;;   - :url was fetched on :verified and the FINAL response was :http
;;     (redirect-resolved — a URL that only answers via a chain of 301s
;;     is recorded at its terminal address, not its historical one).
;;   - :mirrors are file paths in this repo, and they must exist.
;;   - URLs are distinct — the same source listed twice is padding,
;;     not two citations.
